				<div class="mfn-builder-content"><div class="section mcb-section mcb-section-0dcffwpfo hide-tablet hide-mobile default-width"   style="padding-bottom:50px" ><div class="mcb-background-overlay"></div><div class="section_wrapper mcb-section-inner mcb-section-inner-0dcffwpfo"><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-27v295z0x three-fourth tablet-three-fourth mobile-one column-margin-10px valign-top clearfix" data-desktop-col="three-fourth" data-tablet-col="tablet-three-fourth" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""  ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-27v295z0x"></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-t8xwv80c9 one tablet-one mobile-one column-margin-0px valign-top clearfix" data-desktop-col="one" data-tablet-col="tablet-one" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style="padding:0px 0px 24px 0px"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-t8xwv80c9"><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-fdp3rer3k two-third tablet-two-third mobile-one column_image" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mcb-column-inner-fdp3rer3k mcb-item-image-inner"><div class="image_frame element_classes image_item scale-with-grid alignnone no_border mfn-mask-shape "  role="link" tabindex="0"><div class="image_wrapper"><a href="https://southsouth-galaxy.org/publications/global-report-on-south-south-and-triangular-cooperation/"  target="_blank" tabindex="-1"><div class="mask"></div><img class="scale-with-grid" style="-webkit-mask-size:;-webkit-mask-position:;" src="https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/UNOSSC_Report_hr.jpg" alt="UNOSSC_Report_hr" title="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/UNOSSC_Report_hr-300x200.jpg 300w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/UNOSSC_Report_hr-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/UNOSSC_Report_hr-768x512.jpg 768w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/UNOSSC_Report_hr-219x146.jpg 219w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/UNOSSC_Report_hr-50x33.jpg 50w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/UNOSSC_Report_hr-113x75.jpg 113w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/UNOSSC_Report_hr-600x400.jpg 600w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/UNOSSC_Report_hr.jpg 1200w"/></a><div class="image_links "><a href="https://southsouth-galaxy.org/publications/global-report-on-south-south-and-triangular-cooperation/" class="link" target="_blank" tabindex="-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 26 26" aria-label="go to link"><defs><style>.path{fill:none;stroke:#333;stroke-miterlimit:10;stroke-width:1.5px;}</style></defs><g><path d="M10.17,8.76l2.12-2.12a5,5,0,0,1,7.07,0h0a5,5,0,0,1,0,7.07l-2.12,2.12" class="path"></path><path d="M15.83,17.24l-2.12,2.12a5,5,0,0,1-7.07,0h0a5,5,0,0,1,0-7.07l2.12-2.12" class="path"></path><line x1="10.17" y1="15.83" x2="15.83" y2="10.17" class="path"></line></g></svg></a></div></div></div>
</div></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-lotbr7ca1 one-third tablet-one-third mobile-one column_column" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mcb-column-inner-lotbr7ca1 mcb-item-column-inner"><div class="column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix" style="padding:0px 60px 0px 0px;"><h1 style="font-size: 134% !important; line-height: 130% !important; font-weight: 600 !important; color: #161922;"><a href="https://southsouth-galaxy.org/publications/global-report-on-south-south-and-triangular-cooperation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UNOSSC Launches Landmark 2025 Global Report on South-South and Triangular Cooperation</a></h1><div style="height: 0px; width: 40%; border-bottom: #009bd7 solid 3px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 18px;"> </div><p class="text_top_fp" style="font-size: 90% !important; line-height: 130% !important;"><a style="color: #161922; text-decoration: none;" href="https://southsouth-galaxy.org/publications/global-report-on-south-south-and-triangular-cooperation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore the United Nations Office for South-South Cooperation’s flagship 2025 Global Report, ‘Bridging Horizons and Continents: Forging Transformative Pathways in South-South and Triangular Cooperation’. The report moves beyond cataloguing practices to offer a strategic roadmap repositioning South-South and triangular cooperation as a core element of global development and multilateral renewal.</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-tgvq4ttj3 two-fifth tablet-two-fifth mobile-one column-margin-20px valign-top clearfix" data-desktop-col="two-fifth" data-tablet-col="tablet-two-fifth" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style="padding:0px 0px 30px 0px"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-tgvq4ttj3"><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-5zmkuxm4n one tablet-one mobile-one column_image nghtitlerrkadj" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mcb-column-inner-5zmkuxm4n mcb-item-image-inner"><div class="image_frame element_classes image_item scale-with-grid alignnone no_border mfn-mask-shape "  role="link" tabindex="0"><div class="image_wrapper"><a href="https://unsouthsouth.org/south-south-cooperation-day-2025/"   tabindex="-1"><div class="mask"></div><img class="scale-with-grid" style="-webkit-mask-size:;-webkit-mask-position:;" src="https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SSC_Day_2024_hr.jpg" alt="SSC_Day_2024_hr" title="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SSC_Day_2024_hr-300x200.jpg 300w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SSC_Day_2024_hr-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SSC_Day_2024_hr-768x512.jpg 768w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SSC_Day_2024_hr-219x146.jpg 219w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SSC_Day_2024_hr-50x33.jpg 50w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SSC_Day_2024_hr-113x75.jpg 113w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SSC_Day_2024_hr-600x400.jpg 600w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SSC_Day_2024_hr.jpg 1200w"/></a><div class="image_links "><a href="https://unsouthsouth.org/south-south-cooperation-day-2025/" class="link"  tabindex="-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 26 26" aria-label="go to link"><defs><style>.path{fill:none;stroke:#333;stroke-miterlimit:10;stroke-width:1.5px;}</style></defs><g><path d="M10.17,8.76l2.12-2.12a5,5,0,0,1,7.07,0h0a5,5,0,0,1,0,7.07l-2.12,2.12" class="path"></path><path d="M15.83,17.24l-2.12,2.12a5,5,0,0,1-7.07,0h0a5,5,0,0,1,0-7.07l2.12-2.12" class="path"></path><line x1="10.17" y1="15.83" x2="15.83" y2="10.17" class="path"></line></g></svg></a></div></div></div>
</div></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-6sr1uzojs one tablet-one mobile-one column_column" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mcb-column-inner-6sr1uzojs mcb-item-column-inner"><div class="column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix" style="padding:0px 40px 0px 0px;"><h3 style="font-size: 110% !important; line-height: 130% !important; font-weight: 600 !important; color: #161922;"><a href="https://unsouthsouth.org/south-south-cooperation-day-2025/" target="" rel="noopener">United Nations Day for South-South Cooperation – 12 September 2025</a></h3><div style="height: 0px; width: 40%; border-bottom: #009bd7 solid 3px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 17px;"> </div><p class="text_top_fp" style="font-size: 90% !important; line-height: 130% !important;"><a style="color: #161922; text-decoration: none;" href="https://unsouthsouth.org/south-south-cooperation-day-2025/" target="" rel="noopener">Coming ahead of the 80th United Nations General Assembly, the 2025 United Nations Day for South-South Cooperation will be commemorated under the theme “New Opportunities and Innovation through South-South and Triangular Cooperation”.</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-e90crzd5y three-fifth tablet-three-fifth mobile-one column-margin-20px valign-top clearfix" data-desktop-col="three-fifth" data-tablet-col="tablet-three-fifth" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style="padding:0px 0px 30px 0px"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-e90crzd5y"><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-eq38qjcjr three-fifth tablet-three-fifth mobile-one column_image nghtitlerrkadj" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mcb-column-inner-eq38qjcjr mcb-item-image-inner"><div class="image_frame element_classes image_item scale-with-grid alignnone no_border mfn-mask-shape "  role="link" tabindex="0"><div class="image_wrapper"><a href="https://southsouth-galaxy.org"  target="_blank" tabindex="-1"><div class="mask"></div><img class="scale-with-grid" style="-webkit-mas