</div></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-ze63m80yn two-fifth tablet-two-fifth mobile-one column_column" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mcb-column-inner-ze63m80yn mcb-item-column-inner"><div class="column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix" style="padding:0px 80px 0px 0px;"><h3 style="font-size: 110% !important; line-height: 130% !important; font-weight: 600 !important; color: #161922;"><a href="https://southsouth-galaxy.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">South-South Galaxy</a></h3><div style="height: 0px; width: 40%; border-bottom: #009bd7 solid 3px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 17px;"> </div><p class="text_top_fp" style="font-size: 90% !important; line-height: 130% !important;"><a style="color: #161922; text-decoration: none;" href="https://southsouth-galaxy.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore South-South Galaxy, a global knowledge sharing and partnership brokering platform on South-South and triangular cooperation.</a></p></div></div></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-3ukw2mzft three-fifth tablet-three-fifth mobile-one column_image nghtitlerrkadj" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mcb-column-inner-3ukw2mzft mcb-item-image-inner"><div class="image_frame element_classes image_item scale-with-grid alignnone no_border mfn-mask-shape "  role="link" tabindex="0"><div class="image_wrapper"><a href="https://unsouthsouth.org/bapa40/"   tabindex="-1"><div class="mask"></div><img class="scale-with-grid" style="-webkit-mask-size:;-webkit-mask-position:;" src="https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/bapa40_front_page.jpg" alt="bapa40_front_page" title="" width="600" height="338" srcset="https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/bapa40_front_page-300x169.jpg 300w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/bapa40_front_page-260x146.jpg 260w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/bapa40_front_page-50x28.jpg 50w, https://unsouthsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/bapa40_front_page-133x75.jpg